We've come a long and incredible way, but we're by no means slowing down. 

We continue to make more interesting, exciting and clever mechanics, and it's all thanks to you and your support.

You get to the next level from Green Moon Bar.

What do you have to do?

- Find a mechanic and exchange stones for a repair kit;
- Find all the geocaches and check them;
- Meet the boss and win the fight.
- A new level awaits you:
- A new type of weapon, the bursting blaster;
- New enemy mobs that you can't eliminate with their regular gun;
- More new mechanics, geocaches, obstacles;
- A new location, in the form of a technical barn;
- New boss that can shoot missiles, hit the floor with a laser beam that comes from the boss on the floor.

And there will be a lot of interesting surprises, which we prepared for you, while passing the level.

Oh, by the way, we have reviewed the sound effects and will try in the next update to make them less overwhelming.

In the meantime, you can watch our demo of the new level and take a look at the screenshots and wait for a new release and the article with a more detailed description.

[b]Tentative release date is by June 15.[/b]

